  "instructions": [
    "Season the bresaola with salt and black pepper before sous-vide cooking at 130°F (54°C) for 1 hour.",
    "Thinly slice the red onion and red bell pepper, and set aside.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and bell pepper to the skillet and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped parsley and thyme to the skillet and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the cooked bresaola to the skillet and stir to combine with the vegetables.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the bresaola is heated through.",
    "Serve the hash hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
